This work is not finished completly, but I think it can show my idea.

- Get ‘Disposal Method‘ from `readExtension()`.
- Create `restore` image, with copying previous image or filling background color.
- Draw current frame and store to `img` Mat.
- Update `lastImage` with `restore` image.

